{"data": [{"author_id": "1838558231590830080", "conversation_id": "2118414338402975868", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:20:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118438382745403636"], "id": "2118438382745403636", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@rohanpaul_ai @VerneRobotics Open weights for a world action model is a big deal for small robotics teams. Wonder how well it transfers to hardware it wasn't trained on.", "url": "https://x.com/Righteousbeing7/status/2118438382745403636"}, {"author_id": "1711203486170566656", "conversation_id": "2118414338402975868", "created_at": "2026-11-05T19:52:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118431213476331946"], "id": "2118431213476331946", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@rohanpaul_ai @VerneRobotics Under 2 hours of demos. That's the bar.", "url": "https://x.com/AIFlow_ML/status/2118431213476331946"}, {"author_id": "2421549210", "conversation_id": "2118414338402975868", "created_at": "2026-11-05T19:18:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118422788935655590"], "id": "2118422788935655590", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@rohanpaul_ai @VerneRobotics Under 2 hours from new industrial task to working demo is wild if it holds up on a real cell. Curious how much of that speed comes from the world action model vs how they set up the task itself.", "url": "https://x.com/gjurekovec/status/2118422788935655590"}, {"author_id": "1216167367958355968", "conversation_id": "2118414338402975868", "created_at": "2026-11-05T19:17:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118422556751413668"], "id": "2118422556751413668", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@rohanpaul_ai @VerneRobotics Verne V0.5, an open-weight world action model. Open weights keep winning, the closed labs can't keep up with the community.", "url": "https://x.com/yzpq6668/status/2118422556751413668"}, {"author_id": "2588345408", "conversation_id": "2118414338402975868", "created_at": "2026-11-05T18:52:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118416099545170284"], "id": "2118416099545170284", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 523, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "V0.5 trains on two objectives at once: predicting the robot’s next actions and predicting what its cameras will see next.\n\nThe video prediction is only there to teach the model how scenes change. \n\nAt runtime, V0.5 outputs actions directly, so the policy gets a world model’s https://t.co/UdxqnUV6rz", "url": "https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2118416099545170284"}, {"author_id": "2588345408", "conversation_id": "2118414338402975868", "created_at": "2026-11-05T18:50:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118415573113880843"], "id": "2118415573113880843", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 152, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "this is cool. \nfeeding V0.5 more pretraining data, with no task-specific fine-tuning at all, roughly doubled its RoboTwin 2.0 success from 23% to 51%.\n\nAnd the trend shows no sign of flattening. That points to a data scaling law for robot manipulation, which is why Verne is now https://t.co/fx7FPSdxIR", "url": "https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2118415573113880843"}, {"author_id": "2588345408", "conversation_id": "2118414338402975868", "created_at": "2026-11-05T18:45:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118414341129335145"], "id": "2118414341129335145", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 269, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "you can put V0.5 to work here: https://t.co/oUr1uES98r\n\ntechnical report: \nhttps://t.co/aostNJjbkU\n\nWeights and model can be found on Huggingface: \nhttps://t.co/TKLDmETK7q\n\nModel and inference code: https://t.co/HJGT575x12", "url": "https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2118414341129335145"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1838558231590830080", "name": "Urbanwarrior79", "username": "Righteousbeing7"}, {"id": "1711203486170566656", "name": "Igor Lessio - Robots/acc - AIFlow Labs", "username": "AIFlow_ML"}, {"id": "2421549210", "name": "Branko Gjurekovec", "username": "gjurekovec"}, {"id": "1216167367958355968", "name": "Oyu｜Grok Bot & AI", "username": "yzpq6668"}, {"id": "2588345408", "name": "Rohan Paul", "username": "rohanpaul_ai"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2118438382745403636", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyxj6wzlglqkabkztx5khy1f2pp", "oldest_id": "2118414341129335145", "result_count": 7}}